# ── AI/agent instruction, plan, and working docs — must never reach the remote ──
# Blanket-ignore markdown, because that is what stray CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md / SUBMISSION.md
# files always are. CAREFUL: this site's CONTENT is also markdown — src/content/work/*.md are
# the workshop case studies — so the negation below is load-bearing. Without it a NEW case
# study would be silently unaddable (existing tracked files would keep working, which is
# exactly what makes the failure hard to notice). .mdx notes are unaffected by *.md.
**/*.md
!README.md
!src/content/**/*.md
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# private LLC / legal drafts — keep out of version control
llc-formation/